<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! sense.trial.runs ~ a frozen trial, supervised end to end

`lares sense trial-run trial-root=<root>` supervises one receipt-bearing operation under a disposable absolute root: intake, the typed content frontier and the semantic view, each leaving a receipt `search` and `status --trial-root` read later. `--freeze-receipt`, `--intent`, `--source-host`, `--model-home` and `--device` (auto, cpu or cuda) shape it.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ trial

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`trial` params=`trial-root/tmp/trial-1 model-home/models device/cpu ~ run one frozen trial on the cpu`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ trial-root · freeze-receipt · intent · source-host · model-home · device

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`trial-root` params=`takes/host-path needs/required ~ the disposable absolute operation root`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`freeze-receipt` params=`takes/host-path ~ the freeze receipt it runs under`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`intent` params=`takes/words ~ the operation's intent`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`source-host` params=`takes/name ~ the host the source came from`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`model-home` params=`takes/host-path ~ the pinned model's home`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`device` params=`takes/word ~ auto, cpu or cuda`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

